    },
    {
      "id": "xiaohan-c2",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "小寒是第二十三个节气。太阳到达黄经285°，寒冷加深。",
        "en": "Xiaohan is the twenty-third term: the Sun reaches 285°. Cold deepens."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017年起有国家标准表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-xiaohan-feature",
        "source-xinhua-xiaohan-2023"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-xiaohan-longitude-285"
      ],
